[b]Speculative Markets 1.1.5[/b]

[list]
[*]The Banking chart now uses your market's depth to show the panic threshold at each leverage level.
[*]When multiple companies earn Blue Chip status or run into trouble in the same month, each event names the right company. Promotion estimates include the bonus from Home of Great Companies.
[*]Overlapping Bear Raids now expire separately. The raid card shows active raiders, fractional monthly damage and when the annual limit has been reached.
[*]Rival action previews account for Exchange size, specialities and defenses. A decisive-win preview shows when another country already holds the capital lure.
[*]Each contest shows when it settles. Competition names the next rival due, and Shore Up shows when protection ends and when you can renew it.
[*]Capital lures transfer only the cash available in the losing investment pool. The receiving pool gets exactly what the losing pool pays.
[/list]
